sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App as Mobile/Web App
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Market as Market Data

  User->>App: Request dashboard
  App->>API: Authenticated API request
  API->>DB: Scoped query by user and portfolio
  API->>Market: Read adjusted daily close rows
  API-->>App: Descriptive metrics and audit breakdowns
